  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/eh26-statement-02> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/Interpretation> .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/eh26-statement-02> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/authoredResource> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/eh26-statement-02> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/body> "SBR: approximately 15.69 and 13.65 µg/mg. Three replicates each, local 15-standard fits. Descriptive standard errors only; no significance or treatment-efficiency inference."@en .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/eh26-statement-02> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/hasKeyPoint> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/eh26-keypoint-02> .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/eh26-statement-02> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/hasSource> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/eh26-source-brief> .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/eh26-statement-03> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/Interpretation> .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/eh26-statement-03> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/authoredResource> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/eh26-statement-03> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/body> "Twister-based thermal extraction and desorption, gas chromatography and mass spectrometry. Polymer-related mass, not particle count, shape or size."@en .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/eh26-statement-03> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/hasSource> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/eh26-source-brief> .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/eh26-statement-04> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/Interpretation> .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/eh26-statement-04> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/authoredResource> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/eh26-statement-04> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/body> "Synthetic illustration, not measured data. TIC: total-ion chromatogram. EIC: extracted-ion chromatogram. A candidate peak or fitted component is not chemical identity. · [qAlgorithms](https://qalgorithms.odea-project.org/)"@en .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/eh26-statement-04> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/bodyFormat> "markdown" .
