  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/eh26-statement-04> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/hasSource> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/eh26-source-brief> .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/eh26-statement-05> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/Interpretation> .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/eh26-statement-05> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/authoredResource> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/eh26-statement-05> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/body> "Every handoff carries an analytical decision. External calibration estimates polymer mass; sample-mass normalization gives content. · [qAlgorithms](https://qalgorithms.odea-project.org/)"@en .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/eh26-statement-05> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/bodyFormat> "markdown" .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/eh26-statement-05> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/hasSource> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/eh26-source-brief> .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/eh26-statement-06> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/Interpretation> .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/eh26-statement-06> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/authoredResource> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/eh26-statement-06> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/body> "qPeaks uses moving windows and asymmetric local models. Joint fitting can connect features across ion traces. · [qAlgorithms](https://qalgorithms.odea-project.org/)"@en .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/eh26-statement-06> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/bodyFormat> "markdown" .
